<title>USA: Pride Petroleum enters credit facility.</title>
<headline>Pride Petroleum enters credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pride Petroleum Services Inc said it has entered into a new bank credit facility in the amount of $100 million with a group of banks led by National Bank of Commerce as syndicate agent and Wells Fargo Bank (Texas), National Association as administrative agent.</p>
<p>The company said other bank participants include Fuji Bank, Hibernia National Bank and Brown Brothers Harriman. The credit facility is for a term of up to five years.</p>
</text>
